]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/media/reed-hastings-netflix-chair.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:47:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Pentagon Seeks Help From Ford and G.M.</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/pentagon-ford-general-motors-defense-production.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/04/16/multimedia/16biz-military-production-01-zkhv/16biz-military-production-01-zkhv-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
The Pentagon has met with Ford Motor and General Motors to gauge whether the auto industry may be able to help the military acquire vehicles, munitions and other hardware.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/pentagon-ford-general-motors-defense-production.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Politics News Site NOTUS to Become ‘The Star’</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/media/notus-news-to-become-the-star.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/04/16/multimedia/16biz-notus-robert-Allbritton-kzct/16biz-notus-robert-Allbritton-kzct-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
Robert Allbritton, the founder of NOTUS and a former owner of Politico, will fund The Star’s expansion.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/media/notus-news-to-become-the-star.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:20:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Roger Adams Dies at 71; Invented the Rolling Sneakers Known as Heelys</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/roger-adams-dead.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
You could walk in them like gym shoes, but if you rocked back on your heels the wheels emerged, turning them into roller skates. In the early 2000s, the company sold millions.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/business/roger-adams-dead.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:42:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>What Heelys, the Sneakers With Wheels, Taught Me About Momentum as a Child</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/16/style/heelys-joy-friendship.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
